# Purpose: Slice C evidence for owner-revalidated but still inactive semantic scope authority.
# @req REQ-CSM-003 REQ-CSM-006 REQ-CSM-008 REQ-CSM-012 REQ-CSM-017 REQ-CSM-024 REQ-CSM-027
# @cover src/compiler/35.semantics/semantic_scope_contribution_v1.spl 80%
# @cover src/compiler/80.driver/cache/gateway/semantic_scope_authority_v1.spl 80%

